---
import CloseModalBtn from "./CloseModalBtn.astro";
---

<div class="project-details">
  <h2>AgendamentosPop</h2>

  <p>
    AgendamentosPop is a comprehensive appointment scheduling solution that I
    developed as a full-stack application, combining a cutting‐edge mobile
    experience with a robust, scalable backend. The project’s goal was to create
    an intuitive system that allows clients to easily book appointments for
    various services while ensuring high performance and reliability behind the
    scenes.
  </p>

  <p class="mt-2 text-sm">
    Company: MGSF Solucoes TI LTDA <br />
    Role: Full-Stack Developer <br />
    Period: November 2019 – December 2020
  </p>

  <div class="w-full bg-gray-400 h-[1px] my-5 md:my-10"></div>

  <h3>Technical Overview</h3>

  <h4 class="mt-2">Mobile Application with React Native</h4>

  <p>
    I built a cross-platform mobile app using React Native, enabling a
    native-like experience on both iOS and Android. This approach allowed me to
    maintain a single codebase while delivering a consistent and responsive user
    interface, ensuring that clients could seamlessly browse services and
    schedule appointments.
  </p>

  <h4>Modern Web Application with Next.js</h4>

  <p class="mb-2">
    In addition to the mobile app, I developed a web application using Next.js,
    which offers the same booking experience as the app. This allows clients to
    schedule appointments without needing to install the app, improving
    accessibility and usability.
  </p>

  <p class="mb-2">Benefits of using Next.js:</p>

  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>SEO Optimization:</strong> The server-side rendering (SSR) capabilities
      ensure that pages load quickly and rank better in search engines.
    </li>

    <li>
      <strong>Performance & Fast Loading:</strong> With static site generation (SSG)
      and incremental static regeneration (ISR), the web app delivers a smooth and
      fast user experience.
    </li>

    <li>
      <strong>Universal Access:</strong> Clients can make appointments directly from
      any device with a browser, eliminating barriers for those who prefer desktop
      booking.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h4>Backend Architecture with Node.js and Docker</h4>

  <p>
    On the backend, I designed and deployed a RESTful API using Node.js. This
    API efficiently handles business logic and data transactions required for
    appointment management. To guarantee consistency across development,
    testing, and production environments, I containerized the backend using
    Docker. This not only simplified deployment but also contributed to a more
    scalable and maintainable infrastructure. Additionally, I implemented a
    CI/CD pipeline using GitHub Actions to automate testing and deployment
    processes, ensuring rapid and reliable releases. I further enhanced system
    robustness by integrating observability tools like Grafana and Prometheus,
    which provide real-time monitoring, alerting, and performance insights for
    proactive system optimization.
  </p>

  <h4>Database Management with MongoDB Atlas</h4>

  <p class="mb-2">
    For data storage, I integrated MongoDB Atlas, a fully managed cloud database
    solution that ensures high availability, automatic scaling, and built-in
    security.
  </p>

  <p class="mb-2">Benefits of MongoDB Atlas:</p>

  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Automatic Scaling:</strong> The database dynamically adjusts resources
      based on traffic and data load.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Global Distribution:</strong> Enables data replication across multiple
      cloud regions, improving performance and redundancy.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Built-in Security Features:</strong> Provides end-to-end encryption
      and automated backups, ensuring compliance and data protection.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h4>User-Centric Design and Responsive Landing Page</h4>

  <p>
    The project also includes a modern, responsive
    <a
      class="text-primary underline"
      href="https://anuncio.agendamentospop.com.br/"
      target="_blank">landing page</a
    >
    that showcases the platform’s features and value proposition. The website reflects
    a design philosophy centered on usability and clarity, ensuring potential clients
    can quickly understand the benefits and ease of the system.
  </p>

  <div class="w-full bg-gray-400 h-[1px] my-5 md:my-10"></div>

  <h3>Development Process</h3>

  <p class="mb-2">
    From conception to deployment, I oversaw the entire software development
    lifecycle for AgendamentosPop:
  </p>

  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Requirement Analysis & Planning:</strong> I gathered and analyzed client
      needs, which informed the system architecture and technology choices.
    </li>

    <li>
      <strong>Design & Prototyping:</strong> Using Figma and design tools, I created
      intuitive UI/UX flows for both the mobile and web applications.
    </li>

    <li>
      <strong>Implementation:</strong>
      <p class="pl-6">
        React Native for the mobile app.<br />
        Next.js for the web application.<br />
        Node.js & Express for the backend.<br />
        MongoDB Atlas for scalable and secure data storage.
      </p>
    </li>

    <li>
      <strong>Containerization & Deployment:</strong> Leveraging Docker for backend
      services ensured a seamless and consistent deployment process.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <div class="w-full bg-gray-400 h-[1px] my-5 md:my-10"></div>

  <p class="mb-4">
    Key Skill: React Native, Next.js, Node.js, Docker, Oracle Server, Socket.io,
    Express.js, MongoDB, Android, iOS, Push Notifications, Geolocation, Grafana,
    Prometheus, In App Subscriptions.
  </p>

  <p>
    AgendamentosPop showcases my ability to design and develop scalable,
    user-centric applications using modern technologies. By integrating mobile,
    web, and cloud technologies, I created a seamless and highly accessible
    booking experience, demonstrating my expertise in full-stack development and
    cloud infrastructure.
  </p>

  <a
    class="button--primary mt-10"
    href="https://anuncio.agendamentospop.com.br/"
    target="_blank">Project website</a
  >

  <CloseModalBtn />
</div>
